# Firebase CLI cache. The platform config files (google-services.json,
# GoogleService-Info.plist, lib/firebase_options.dart) ARE committed: they
# identify the project, they are not secrets, and a clone must build with one
# command. Access is controlled by firestore.rules, not by hiding these.
.firebase/
